   "title": "docs(paperclip): shutdown resume guide and task history archive (DIG-335)",
   "body": "Paperclip shutdown archive for **humm** ([DIG-335](https://paperclip.digikal.com/DIG/issues/DIG-335), parent DIG-332).\n\nAdds `docs/paperclip/shutdown-2026-10-03/` only: resume guide (`README.md`), cutoff inventory, frozen planned work, blocker/decision log, branch/SHA/PR inventory, setup commands quoted from this repo's existing docs, one page per issue (description, acceptance criteria, documents, interactions, all comments), earlier document revisions, SHA-256-verified attachments and JSON data. It contains no product change and no secrets.\n\n**WIP \u2014 baseline.** Do not merge yet. A final delta adds ReleaseEngineer's source-preservation manifest (DIG-334) and DevGuru's in-flight disposition (DIG-333), then this PR goes to DevGuru for review under DIG-250. TechLead merges after approval.\n\nVerification: fresh `git clone --depth 1 -b docs/paperclip-shutdown-2026-10-03` of this repo, README present, `sha256sum -c data/attachments.sha256` passes from the archive folder, and a secret-pattern scan of the generated tree is clean apart from synthetic test values.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
